    "detailed_description": "Birds Aren\u2019t Real is a 3D sandbox game with a comic twist. <br><br>Based on the real-life satirical conspiracy theory, play as a government surveillance pigeon drone, using sneaky maneuvers and creative thinking to manipulate the citizens and dispel their suspicions about the government's avian task force.<br><br>Fly around to explore and <strong>surveil</strong> your surroundings!<br><br><strong>Sabotage</strong> the conspiracists working against your organization!<br><br>Deploy your<strong> poop</strong> in order to undermine your political detractors!<br><br>Birds Aren\u2019t Real aims to find some humor in a time of misinformation and distrust. It's a game for anyone that may need a brief escape from what at times can seem like an overwhelming and deeply pessimistic world. <br><br>We invite anyone and everyone to give our game a try!",
